findings.fix:
Add `#pendingRefresh: Promise<RepositorySnapshot> | null = null` to RepositoryService and wrap refresh():
  refresh(): Promise<RepositorySnapshot> {
    this.#pendingRefresh ??= this.#runRefresh().finally(() => { this.#pendingRefresh = null })
    return this.#pendingRefresh
  }
Move the current body into #runRefresh(). Clear #pendingRefresh in dispose() (repository.ts:1269). One semantic caveat: a caller that mutated the tree and then calls refresh() must not be handed a walk that started before its write -- switchBranch (repository.ts:2050), pullCurrentBranch (:2142) and checkoutPullRequest (:2375) should call #runRefresh() directly to bypass the dedupe, or the dedupe should be keyed on a monotonically bumped mutation counter.
